/*  An object made in the rabbit holds a series from outside it; a rabbit's series is stored through the field.
    Obligation broken: O2, a store needs to know exactly where its target lives. See docs/SOUNDNESS.md.  */

Define object bag with (the series of series of number items).
Define outer as a series of series of number.
Pull a rabbit.
    Define b as a new bag { the items outer }.
    Define inner as a series of number with (1, 2, 3).
    Insert inner into b's items.
Done.

/*  Make and drop enough values that freed memory is handed out again. */
Define churn as a series of text.
Define tick as 0.
While tick is less than 400, repeat:
    Insert ("zzzzzzzz" joined to "yyyyyyyy") into churn.
    tick becomes tick + 1.
Done.
State outer.
